- name: defigma_shape
  type: table
  desc: DefigmaShape custom GUI node functions (native, call from a gui_script)
  members:
  - name: set_arc
    type: function
    desc: Sets the Figma arc of a DefigmaShape ellipse node and rebuilds its vertices on the next frame.
    parameters:
    - name: node
      type: node
      desc: DefigmaShape node
    - name: start
      type: number
      desc: arc start in degrees, clockwise from the right (Figma Start)
    - name: sweep
      type: number
      desc: sweep in percent, 0-100 (Figma Sweep)
    - name: ratio
      type: number
      desc: inner radius in percent of the outer radius, 0-100 (Figma Ratio)
  - name: set_sweep
    type: function
    desc: Sets only the sweep of the arc, keeping its start and ratio (a progress ring).
    parameters:
    - name: node
      type: node
      desc: DefigmaShape node
    - name: sweep
      type: number
      desc: sweep in percent, 0-100
  - name: get_arc
    type: function
    desc: Returns the arc of a DefigmaShape node.
    parameters:
    - name: node
      type: node
      desc: DefigmaShape node
    returns:
    - name: start
      type: number
    - name: sweep
      type: number
    - name: ratio
      type: number
  - name: set_paints
    type: function
    desc: Replaces the fills and the strokes of a DefigmaShape node (JSON arrays in the format of its fills and strokes properties) and rebuilds it on the next frame.
    parameters:
    - name: node
      type: node
      desc: DefigmaShape node
    - name: fills
      type: string
      desc: JSON array of paints, e.g. [{"type":"solid","color":[1,1,1,1]}]
    - name: strokes
      type: string
      desc: JSON array of paints
  - name: get_paints
    type: function
    desc: Returns the fills and the strokes of a DefigmaShape node as JSON arrays.
    parameters:
    - name: node
      type: node
      desc: DefigmaShape node
    returns:
    - name: fills
      type: string
    - name: strokes
      type: string
